@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title SQLite audit schema
entity audit_records {
  * id : INTEGER <<PK AUTOINCREMENT>>
  --
  * timestamp : TEXT (ISO-8601 UTC)
  * attributes_json : TEXT (JSON object)
  * effect : TEXT (PERMIT / DENY)
  policy_id : TEXT (nullable)
  * reason : TEXT
}
note right of audit_records
Policy configuration lives in JSON files.
policy_id is a label, not a foreign key.
No patient/person database is created.
No fictional tables or relations are shown.
end note
@enduml
